Zwift Ride / DirCon protocol facts (mDNS TXT, DirCon property bits, GET pages, the
DEV_INFO page bytes) were learned from BikeControl (https://github.com/OpenBikeControl/bikecontrol,
GPL-3.0 era sources) and ZwiftBridge, and verified against Zwift on 2026-10-13.

V-Steer.exe (built with PyInstaller) bundles:
- Python (PSF License)
- bleak (MIT) - https://github.com/hbldh/bleak
- pywinrt / winrt-* packages (MIT) - https://github.com/pywinrt/pywinrt
- python-zeroconf (LGPL-2.1-or-later) - https://github.com/python-zeroconf/python-zeroconf
- ifaddr (MIT) - https://github.com/ifaddr/ifaddr
- the PyInstaller bootloader (GPL-2.0-or-later with the bootloader exception)
To use a different version of any of them, rebuild the exe from source with build.cmd
(see docs/how-it-works.md).
